sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SQS as "AWS SQS Queue"
    participant Lambda as "AWS Lambda Handler"
    participant PreProc as "Image Processor"
    participant GCP as "Google Cloud Vision"
    participant GPT as "OpenAI GPT-4o (ThreadPool)"
    participant Rules as "Danish Tax Rules Engine"
    participant PG as "PostgreSQL (Win-Man)"
    participant o3 as "Auto-Accountant (o3-mini)"

    SQS->>Lambda: SQS Message (receipt_id, typing_output_id, action)
    Lambda->>PG: is_task_open(typing_output_id)
    PG-->>Lambda: True (Task Active)

    Lambda->>PreProc: Download & downsample receipt image (LANCZOS)
    PreProc->>GCP: text_detection(image_bytes)
    GCP-->>PreProc: Hierarchical TextAnnotation
    PreProc-->>Lambda: Normalized OCR text

    par Parallel Dual-Schema Parsing
        Lambda->>GPT: Core Prompt: Date hierarchy, DKK prioritization + Base64 image
        GPT-->>Lambda: ReceiptData (Date, Amount, Currency, VatAmount, Degrees, Matching)
    and Parallel Dual-Schema Parsing
        Lambda->>GPT: Reconciliation Prompt: CVR, IBAN, Line Items + Base64 image
        GPT-->>Lambda: ReconciliationData (seller_name, seller_cvr, payment_method, card_last_4)
    end

    Lambda->>Rules: Validate Danish VAT (Brutto = Netto * 1.25) & Date hierarchy
    alt VAT / Math Discrepancy or Missing Mandatory Fields
        Rules-->>Lambda: Tax calculation inconsistency or missing key
        Lambda->>Lambda: Invalidate matching_information (Set to None)
        Lambda->>PG: Log audit flag to task_bots.logs
    else Valid Mathematical Verification
        Rules-->>Lambda: Verification Passed
    end

    Lambda->>Lambda: clean_parsed_data (Strip null bytes \x00, sanitize empty tokens)
    Lambda->>PG: SET session.username = 'da@revisor1.dk'
    Lambda->>PG: UPDATE double_entry.typing_output (Core fields)
    Lambda->>PG: UPDATE task_bots.typer_bot_output (JSONB audit payload)
    Lambda->>PG: UPDATE double_entry.receipt_ocrs (Extended reconciliation metadata)
    Lambda-->>SQS: Delete / ACK Message

    Note over PG,o3: Autonomous Asynchronous Reconciliation Phase
    o3->>PG: Query unbooked bank feeds & receipts_for_bank_based_accounting
    o3->>o3: Analyze bank_text regex patterns & VAT codes (I25/U25)
    o3->>PG: Propose INSERT INTO bank_transaction_rules (active = false)
    PG-->>o3: Rules Staged for Auditor 1-Click Verification
